==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Blitzle|53}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Blitzle|35}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Zap Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Emerald|Manectric|16}} from the {{TCG|EX Emerald}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

